The relationship between PKU and Maple Syrup Urine Disease (MSUD) highlights the interconnectedness of metabolic disorders. MSUD is related to the management of PKU, indicating that patients may require a broader understanding of metabolic conditions. This connection suggests that the community may also benefit from collaborative approaches in managing multiple metabolic disorders, enhancing overall patient care. [Data: Entities (10538); Relationships (18325)]# JPEN and Nutrition Support Community

