## Impact on weight management and obesity

The Mediterranean Diet is recommended as an effective dietary pattern for weight management and improving metabolic health. It emphasizes whole foods and healthy fats while limiting processed foods and sugars, which can help individuals maintain a healthy weight. Effective weight management strategies are crucial for addressing obesity, and the Mediterranean Diet provides a sustainable approach that promotes long-term lifestyle changes. [Data: Relationships (11234, 8093, 7761, 7764, +more)]

